Tg-IDE-bot — Python 3.14, python-telegram-bot v20 (polling) + aiohttp on :8080, mss /
pyautogui / pygetwindow for the machine, pytest for the proof. Windows-only by design.

The rules of this repo are in AGENTS.md at the root. Read it. Do not copy it here.

Canonical knowledge is the wiki in docs/. Read docs/README.md before working: preflight,
update regulation, document map, concept index.

Before touching a feature, read its file in docs/chunks/features/ — that is where the
failure history lives, and skipping it is how a fixed bug comes back.

Set your row in docs/ROADMAP.md to ▶ before the first edit; ✅ or ⏸ (with what remains and
where it is) when you stop.

Never commit or push unless the operator says "Current branch" or "New branch". Version and
changelog wait for "Let's finish".

After changes, follow the "Update regulation" in docs/README.md, then:
    python -m pytest tests/ -q
    python tools/wiki/check-links.py && python tools/wiki/wiki-doctor.py

Cite ids (D-nnn, A-nnn, B-n) instead of restating what they say.

---
This file is a legacy shim. Current Cursor versions read AGENTS.md natively, so if your
whole team is on a recent build you can delete it. It is shipped because a stale editor
silently reading nothing is worse than one duplicated pointer.
